  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Refugee Council - Water supply</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to support the reconstruction and recovery in Mykolaivska Oblasts through restoration of sustainable access to clean water in areas of need. This will be done by supporting the Mykolaiv authorities and Vodokanal to install the unused pipes through targeted technical, procurement and quality assurance support to ensure the restoration of sustainable access to clean water of the most affected population. Moreover, the capacity and governance mechanisms of Vodokanal will be strengthened towards a more efficient, transparent, and accountable water supply reconstruction and water management in Mykolaivska oblast.</narrative>
  </description>
